# Gate step 1349-tdpg — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq).
#
# WHAT IT GUARDS is the census that reports how old our self-flagged evidence
# debt is, and specifically that its COUNT can be shown to respond.
#
# WHY A COUNT NEEDS A FIXTURE AT ALL. A count is the least self-announcing
# result there is: "3 hits" and "my pattern matches nothing, and 3 unrelated
# lines happen to contain the word" are the same output. The fixture plants ONE
# dated admission beside a decoy containing the same words while admitting
# nothing ("we measured this and someone verified it") and requires exactly one
# hit, so the number is known to discriminate rather than merely to exist.
#
# IT EARNED ITS KEEP BEFORE THE CENSUS EVER RAN ON THIS REPO. Arm 1 failed on
# the first execution: the census counted LINES, and the specimen comment is two
# lines. Counting lines makes the number rise with how carefully someone wrapped
# their prose — the mention-count heuristic's anti-correlation with care,
# reintroduced through formatting.
#
# ARM 5 IS THE CONTROL ON THE CONTROL: a second admission must move the count
# 1 -> 2. Without it, an arm-1 pass is consistent with a census hardcoded to
# answer 1. ARM 4 pins that the census exits 0 WITH hits present, because it is
# a report and never a gate (1338-x5rq's 187 suppressions: gate on an
# instrument that matches honest deferred notes and the rational response is to
# stop writing the note, which destroys the only signal it has).
#
# WHY IT IS HERE AT ALL (885-92iu). Written and green in its author's hand on
# 2026-09-22, referenced by nothing. check-added-test-is-referenced named it
# that same night and the warn was pushed past, because on a work ref a fatal
# decider and an advisory one print the same shape (1352-qbrd).
#
# STEP_SCRIPT is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
STEP_DESC="Checking the admitted-missing-evidence census counts admissions, not words (1349-tdpg)"
STEP_SCRIPT="scripts/test-census-admitted-missing-evidence.sh"
STEP_ERROR="the evidence-debt census no longer discriminates (1349-tdpg) — read which arm failed above; arm 1 (the decoy must NOT be counted) and arm 5 (a second admission must move the count) are the load-bearing ones, and arm 4 pins that it stays a report rather than a gate"
STEP_OK="The evidence-debt census counts admissions and its count is shown to move"
#
# SECOND REGIME (macneo, 2026-09-22 darwin). This fixture touches no bounding
# tool and no network: it plants a two-file scratch repo, commits with a pinned
# author date, and reads ages back through git blame. Nothing in it is
# platform-conditional, which is why its number is identical on both regimes.
STEP_SECOND_REGIME="macneo 2026-09-22 darwin ok:census-admitted-missing-evidence-fixture:8"
